WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.000 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
The outcome is a working app with a tested filter, not just generated

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:18.000 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
HTML or a screenshot.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:26.000 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
Dashboard controls manage the workspace. OpenCode writes the app;

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:34.000 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
Harakiri supplies terminal, files, routes and cleanup.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:43.000 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
Use the OpenCode template. Add model configuration before Create

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:52.000 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
sandbox; do not paste a Harakiri API key into the form.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:01:03.000 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
Select Create sandbox. Wait for running and for Terminal to report

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:14.000 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
attached before sending commands.

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:26.000 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
Three synthetic releases, a real select filter, a health endpoint, and

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:38.000 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
Node standard library only.

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:49.000 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
OpenCode must write files and execute tools. It must leave the server

00:01:49.000 --> 00:02:00.000 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
stopped so you control when the preview starts.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:12.000 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
The command runs remotely. Do not close or kill the sandbox while the

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:24.000 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
agent is writing files.

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:34.000 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
The recording contains completed file-writing and bash tools. Completed

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:44.000 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
model steps reported cost 0.

00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:53.000 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
Both requested files exist. A success message without files is not an

00:02:53.000 --> 00:03:02.000 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
accepted result.

00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:12.000 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
Syntax passes and local health returns {"ok":true}. The app listens on

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:22.000 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
0.0.0.0:3000 for the route to reach it.

00:03:22.000 --> 00:03:32.000 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
Port 3000, HTTP, Public. The generated preview /health returned HTTP 200

00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:42.000 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
and {"ok":true} in the capture.

00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:52.000 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
Passed displays Portal only. All restores Portal, Search and Billing.

00:03:52.000 --> 00:04:02.000 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
Test behavior, not appearance alone.

00:04:02.000 --> 00:04:12.000 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
The UI Kill action terminated the recorded runtime, and the public route

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:22.000 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
stopped serving the application.
